{
  "name": "WooCommerce - Post-delivery review request",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post-delivery review request\nTriggers when an order becomes **completed**, waits N days (Config > waitDays), re-checks the order and sends a review request by WhatsApp template or email.\nOrder meta `_review_request_scheduled` / `_review_requested` prevents duplicates. Create the WhatsApp template \"review_request\" with 3 body variables: name, product, link.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      },
      "id": "f3ace928-6109-4aa7-a440-64b14378329f",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "order.updated"
      },
      "id": "c7e8d7cb-0ff8-4788-afa7-c0f51eee4d21",
